Lab Exercise: Automating Auto-Suggest Dropdown in Flipkart using Playwright and Pytest
1. Open Flipkart Website
o Navigate to https://www.flipkart.com/
2. Type Search Query
o Locate the search box
o Type "smart" into the search field
3. Capture and Print Suggestions
o Get all suggestion elements
o Print the number of suggestions
o Print the 5th suggestion (if available)
o Print all suggestions one by one
4. Select Specific Suggestion
o Loop through all suggestions
o If a suggestion matches "smartphone", click on it to select it
5. Assertion
o Check at least one suggestion is present
Expected Output
• The number of suggestions should be printed in the terminal.
• The 5th suggestion (if available) should be displayed.
• All suggestions should be listed in the output.
• If "smartphone" appears, it should be automatically clicked.